    "commit_message": "* fix(insights): pass correct sendEvent to html template\r\n\r\nThere was an existing prop called `sendEvent`, which we passed through to the component when we introduced html templates. However, this sendEvent was actually sendEventToInsights, which is of course problematic, as it doesn't match the documentation, nor does it add the necessary conversion from a simple \"three argument\" form to \"object form\".\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the prop that existed from sendEventToInsights to sendEvent which comes from the connector.\r\n\r\ndiscovered in https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch/discussions/5447#discussioncomment-4779169\r\n\r\n* refactor: pass through same sendEvent\r\n\r\n* nits :)",
    "commit_title": "fix(insights): pass correct sendEvent to html template (#5457)",
